    "title": "Backstage News On WWE's Plans For 2026 Raw & Smackdown Commentary Teams - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ewrestling ,\n1 hours ago According to PWInsider.com, via Fightful.com, WWE plans to rearrange the commentary teams for RAW and SmackDown at the start of 2026. As part of these changes, Michael Cole and Corey Graves will return to Monday Night RAW, while the SmackDown team will consist of Joe Tessitore and Wade Barrett. This... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
